## 5. Paging — you are on the pager for {{ onboard_env }}
Being granted this tier put you on it (ADR 1168). Alerts about the goatnet's own
infrastructure reach the self-hosted pager at `https://{{ op_ntfy_map[onboard_env].fqdn }}`.

1. Install the ntfy app (iOS / Android / desktop) and add a server: `https://{{ op_ntfy_map[onboard_env].fqdn }}`.
2. Log in as `{{ operator_handle }}` with the password in `ntfy.pass` beside this file (0600 — keep it there).
3. Subscribe to{% for t in op_ntfy_map[onboard_env].topics %} `goat-{{ op_ntfy_map[onboard_env].goatnet }}-{{ t }}`{% if not loop.last %} and{% endif %}{% endfor %}.
   `critical` is the page; `warning` is the backlog. Subscribe to critical at minimum.

Nothing about your phone or address is stored anywhere — the topic is the only
thing the goatnet knows. Losing the tier removes your read access in the same act.
